-- New Frontiers: the keeps and their structures.
--
-- Generated from dol-db by tools/frontier.sh -- do not hand-edit.
--
-- 105 keeps and their components, all in region 163. Twenty-one of them carry
-- the same KeepIDs as our old-frontier keeps and the SAME NAMES: Caer Benowyc,
-- Bledmeer Faste, Dun Crauchon and the rest. New Frontiers is not a different
-- set of keeps, it is the same keeps standing somewhere else, which is why
-- this is a swap and why the two sets can never be loaded at once.
--
-- Applied only by tools/frontier.sh, which clears the other set first.



UPDATE regions SET IsFrontier = 1 WHERE RegionID = 163;
UPDATE regions SET IsFrontier = 0 WHERE RegionID IN (1, 100, 200);
